      "text": "GUIDED RESPONSE\n\n1. Capture deployment context\n\n2. Validate baseline controls\n\n3. Check health and telemetry\n\n4. Publish handoff status",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
